* Kitaguchi Hongū Fuji Sengen Shrine East Hall (Structure) - Designated August 28, 1907
* Kitaguchi Hongū Fuji Sengen Shrine West Hall (Structure) - Designated March 31, 1953
* Kitaguchi Hongū Fuji Sengen Shrine main hall (附: 1 board) (Structure) - Designated March 31, 1953
* Kitaguchi Hongū Fuji Sengen Shrine 8 buildings (Structure) - Designated November 28, 2017
** Haiden and Heiden
** Ebisu-sha and Tōbei
** Kaguraden
** Chōzuya (附: 1 board)
** Zuishinmon (附: 1 board)
** Fukuchi Hachiman-sha (附: 2 boards)
** Suwa Shrine Haiden
** Office (附: 1 board)
** (附 designated) Lantern 1 piece
* Tachi Sword with inscription "Bishu Osafune Kageie Bun'an 2nd year February" (附: Itomaki Tachi Koshirae) (Craftwork) - Designated March 28, 1923

