==Episode==
* According to the Deputy Priest, there was a business named Fujisan Jidōsha (Mount Fuji Automobile) operating on adjacent land. When the company went out of business, the land was nearly purchased by Chinese investors. Fuji Kyūkō stepped in and bought the land, offering it as a free parking lot for shrine visitors. According to the Deputy Priest, Fuji Kyūkō purchased the land "for the sake of the shrine out of goodwill" without any other intended use<ref>{{Citation|title=【前田日明】日本武尊の聖域を参拝！！不思議な現象も？【久保サラ夫妻】|url=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GaEeHx62UX4|accessdate=2021-06-15|language=ja-JP}}（7:40~)</ref>.

